WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.027
Talking to your phone can feel like talking to no one. So something listens.

2
00:00:07.327 --> 00:00:10.874
Press record, and its ears go up. They stay up until you're done.

3
00:00:12.174 --> 00:00:16.317
After you've talked for a while, your phone may ask one small question back.

4
00:00:17.617 --> 00:00:20.980
Not advice. Just a question about something you actually said.

5
00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:27.228
Answer it if you want, and your answer is saved as a reply to that entry.

6
00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:33.810
The listener is there from your first recording. The question needs Apple Intelligence.
